---
subject: Your sign-in link for <%= it.appName %>
---
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#09090b;">Sign in to <%= it.appName %></h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;">Click the button below to sign in. This link is single-use and expires in <%= it.expiresInMinutes %> minute<%= it.expiresInMinutes === 1 ? '' : 's' %>.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0;"><tr><td align="center" style="border-radius:8px;background-color:#2563eb;"><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 26px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Sign in</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br /><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none;word-break:break-all;"><%= it.url %></a></p>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If you didn't request this email, you can safely ignore it.</p>
===TEXT===
Sign in to <%= it.appName %>

Open the link below to sign in. This link is single-use and expires in
<%= it.expiresInMinutes %> minute(s).

  <%= it.url %>

If you didn't request this email, you can safely ignore it.
